From 02e001301435131e78c7079981d0fb8ab3b4ab23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:56:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: cadence: sky1-cix: native-mode review fixes (clocks,
 AER, pdev name, ECAM size)

Follow-up to the v7.3 native-mode re-port, from code review.
Each finding was checked against the source first.

- Clocks (0029): sky1_pcie_parse_clocks() logged a failed lookup, stored
  the ERR_PTR in pcie->pcie_{axi,apb}_clk / pcie_refclk_b and returned 0.
  clk_prepare_enable() then dereferenced the ERR_PTR. The r277 code does
  the same. Lookups now go through sky1_pcie_get_clk():
    - under ACPI, clk_get_sys(acpi_dev_name()) plus a devm clk_put;
    - -ENOENT (CLKT bridge not registered yet) turns into -EPROBE_DEFER,
      or NULL for the optional refclk_b;
    - errors are returned, never stored.
  The probe no longer turns sky1_pcie_parse_property() errors into
  -EINVAL, so -EPROBE_DEFER reaches the driver core.
- AER: the root handler re-enabled PCI_ERR_ROOT_COMMAND at the PCIe
  capability offset instead of the AER extended capability. It read from
  aer_offset and wrote to offset, so after the first error the root-port
  AER interrupt stayed disabled. This was pre-existing, from the 7.2
  vendor code.
- pci-sky1-acpi.c names the synthetic platform device "sky1-pcie-cix"
  after the vendor driver. As "sky1-pcie" it name-matched mainline
  pci-sky1.c (DT only), which ran a probe that could only fail. The vendor
  driver still binds by its ACPI match table.
- cdns_pcie_hpa_create_region_for_ecam() rejects a zero-size cfg
  resource (fls64(-1) would program a 2^63 window), and the caller now
  propagates the error.

Only the native path (sky1_pcie_native on) is affected. The default
sky1_pcie_native=off path is unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe-specific]
Signed-off-by: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
---
 .../pci/controller/cadence/pci-sky1-acpi.c    |   7 +-
 drivers/pci/controller/cadence/pci-sky1-cix.c | 171 ++++++------------
 .../cadence/pcie-cadence-host-hpa.c           |  10 +-
 3 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 117 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pci/controller/cadence/pci-sky1-acpi.c b/drivers/pci/controller/cadence/pci-sky1-acpi.c
index 06fc929fbb0e50dec938d455ddda9fff0925eb32..b7fce4582ccaaf400ff362dd4f6b85ce6432ae31 100644
